# Nougat MMD extraction — stub

**Status:** placeholder. Not run at original replication time (2026-06-22).

**Reason:** the analytical-layer replication for this paper only required
retrieval of published parameter constants and functional-form definitions,
which were reliably available via `pdftotext -layout` (see
`ocr/raw_layout.txt`) and directly from the authors' public source code
(`source/author_mgm.py`, verbatim from
`github.com/MGHPhysicsResearch/MGM`). A Nougat MMD extract was therefore
not on the critical path for this replication.

**Paper:** Bertolet A., Chamseddine I., Paganetti H., Schuemann J. (2023).
"The complexity of DNA damage by radiation follows a Gamma distribution:
insights from the Microdosimetric Gamma Model."
*Frontiers in Oncology* 13:1196502.
doi:10.3389/fonc.2023.1196502

**If a future replicator wants the full MMD:** re-run Nougat on
`source/paper.pdf` (Meta AI's `nougat` package, `nougat source/paper.pdf -o
extraction/`). The paper is open-access and the PDF is deposited under
`source/paper.pdf`.

**Backfill note:** this stub was added 2026-07-06 to bring the artifact
inventory into alignment with the 8-artifact LUCID-Second100 standard.
The absence of a real MMD does not affect the replication's coverage or
agreement scores (7/10, 9/10) because the parameter constants and
functional forms were obtained from the authors' source code, not from
the paper text alone.
